Step 1 — Download and extract
Tap Download the fix ZIP above on your phone.

Open your phone's Files app.

Go to Downloads.

Tap SmartQClinic-PWA-Fix.zip.

Choose Extract.

You should see four files: manifest.webmanifest, sw.js, icon-192.png and icon-512.png.

