Great! Now we'll upload the two new app icons first.

Step 1 — Upload the icons to GitHub
Open your SmartQClinic repository.

Tap Add file → Upload files.

Open the extracted SmartQClinic-PWA-Fix folder.

Select these two files:

icon-192.png

icon-512.png

Make sure they are uploaded directly into the main repository, at the same level as index.html.

Enter this commit summary: Add SmartQ Clinic app icons.

Keep Commit directly to the main branch selected.

Tap Commit changes.

Don't upload UPLOAD-INSTRUCTIONS.txt.

Tell me when the two icons are uploaded. Next, we'll update the two existing configuration files.

