Worked for 11s
Perfect! Both icons are in the correct location. ✅

Now we need to replace the old installation manifest.

Step 2 — Update manifest.webmanifest
Open manifest.webmanifest in GitHub.

Tap the pencil icon to edit.

Select and delete all the existing text.

Copy and paste this complete replacement:

{
  "id": "./",
  "name": "SmartQ Clinic",
  "short_name": "SmartQ",
  "description": "SmartQ Clinic queue and appointment prototype",
  "start_url": "./index.html",
  "scope": "./",
  "display": "standalone",
  "background_color": "#f5f8f6",
  "theme_color": "#176b50",
  "icons": [
    {
      "src": "./icon-192.png",
      "sizes": "192x192",
      "type": "image/png",
      "purpose": "any maskable"
    },
    {
      "src": "./icon-512.png",
      "sizes": "512x512",
      "type": "image/png",
      "purpose": "any maskable"
    }
  ]
}

Scroll down and tap Commit changes.

Keep Commit directly to the main branch selected.

Tell me when you've saved it. Then we'll update the final file, sw.js.





